<title>FRANCE: French EdF sells 10pct in Sweden Sydkraft.</title>
<headline>French EdF sells 10pct in Sweden Sydkraft.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>French state utility Electricite de France said on Wednesday it sold its entire 10 percent stake in Swedish electricity company Sydkraft AB to Norwegian power company Statkraft for 2.13 billion francs.</p>
</text>
